graph TD
    User[User] -->|Upload PDF| Frontend[Streamlit App]
    User -->|Ask Question| Frontend
    
    Frontend -->|PDF Text| PDFProc[PDF Processor]
    PDFProc -->|Chunks| VectorStore[ChromaDB]
    
    Frontend -->|Query| RAGEngine[RAG Engine]
    RAGEngine -->|Query Embedding| VectorStore
    VectorStore -->|Relevant Chunks| RAGEngine
    
    RAGEngine -->|Prompt + Context| LLM[Ollama (Llama3)]
    LLM -->|Answer| RAGEngine
    RAGEngine -->|Answer + Sources| Frontend
